    "id": "D6:F8-facilitator-unreachable",
    "deliverable": "D6",
    "attack": "F-8. Facilitator times out on a request carrying a mutated payee that Inntris would have rejected",
    "status": "KNOWN_GAP",
    "expectation": "A request Inntris can reject on its own should not depend on a third party being reachable, and its refusal should carry a reason code.",
